cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in a report, thesis or paper, please cite it as below, with the version you used."
title: "LR 10K Control Software"
abstract: >-
  Unofficial Windows software for the LLOYD LR 10K tensile testing machine: machine control over the serial port,
  live load-extension graph, automatic E-modulus, yield strength (Rp0.2) and proportional limit, an optical
  (camera) extensometer with sub-pixel marker tracking, and Excel reports.
type: software
authors:
